WEBVTT

00:07:29.737 --> 00:07:30.946
six-pack rings,

00:07:30.946 --> 00:07:32.823
reusable food containers,

00:07:32.823 --> 00:07:34.700
straws and utensils.

00:07:34.909 --> 00:07:36.994
Now hopefully they put
some systems in place

00:07:36.994 --> 00:07:40.456
for some people who need those things
for accessibility purposes,

00:07:40.456 --> 00:07:42.458
but this is a step in the right direction,

00:07:42.458 --> 00:07:43.501
and I’m excited.

00:07:45.169 --> 00:07:48.255
Gabrielle Langhorn: From desertification
to bountiful vegetation,

00:07:48.255 --> 00:07:52.051
a community in Cearà, Brazil has been
able to rehabilitate their landscape

00:07:52.051 --> 00:07:55.346
using amazing collective action
and funding from FUNCEME.

00:07:55.679 --> 00:07:56.764
Water is flowing,

00:07:56.764 --> 00:07:57.765
crops are growing

00:07:57.765 --> 00:07:59.517
and you can truly see a difference.